30
00:01:01,176 --> 00:01:04,027
Every number comes from a published source,

31
00:01:04,027 --> 00:01:05,750
listed in the description.

32
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:07,877
And there is one more twist.

33
00:01:08,057 --> 00:01:10,087
The car that Ford sold for about

34
00:01:10,087 --> 00:01:12,561
half a million dollars was being valued

35
00:01:12,561 --> 00:01:15,225
at close to eight hundred thousand dollars

36
00:01:15,225 --> 00:01:15,986
years later.

37
00:01:16,166 --> 00:01:18,349
But first, the car itself.

38
00:01:18,700 --> 00:01:20,378
According to Wikipedia,

39
00:01:20,378 --> 00:01:23,515
Ford showed the second-generation GT at the

40
00:01:23,515 --> 00:01:27,382
twenty fifteen North American International Auto Show

41
00:01:27,382 --> 00:01:28,185
in Detroit.

42
00:01:28,365 --> 00:01:31,883
Production began in December twenty sixteen.

43
00:01:32,063 --> 00:01:34,517
The cars were built not by Ford

44
00:01:34,517 --> 00:01:36,576
itself, but by Multimatic,

45
00:01:36,576 --> 00:01:39,031
