49
00:01:44,290 --> 00:01:46,124
Its engine surprised people.

50
00:01:46,304 --> 00:01:47,716
Instead of a V8,

51
00:01:47,716 --> 00:01:50,365
the GT used a three point five

52
00:01:50,365 --> 00:01:52,924
liter twin-turbo EcoBoost V6,

53
00:01:52,924 --> 00:01:56,014
related to the engines Ford uses in

54
